    # DROS @ lewd "I suppose I should just come out and say it, shouldn't I?"
    DROS @ lewd "그냥 솔직히 말해야겠지, 그렇지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/scr_getDrosAndRitual.rpy:99
translate kr dros_4_getDros_2994bbc9:

    # DROS @ lewd "You're... {i}Very attractive.{/i}"
    DROS @ lewd "너는... {i}정말 매력적이야.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/scr_getDrosAndRitual.rpy:100
translate kr dros_4_getDros_11b3ff7b:

    # "The comment was a surprising one, if they had given any hints prior to this, they certainly went over my head."
    "그 말은 놀라웠다. 전에 어떤 암시라도 있었다면, 분명 내가 알아채지 못한 것이리라."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/scr_getDrosAndRitual.rpy:101
translate kr dros_4_getDros_027e0d9e:

    # DROS @ smile "I mean, you've done so much for me."
    DROS @ smile "내 말은, 네가 나를 위해 정말 많이 해줬잖아."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/scr_getDrosAndRitual.rpy:102
translate kr dros_4_getDros_89e312b0:

    # DROS @ smile "And now I look like this, I finally feel I have the confidence to ask these things."
    DROS @ smile "그리고 이제 이런 모습이 되고 나니, 드디어 이런 걸 물어볼 자신감이 생겼어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/scr_getDrosAndRitual.rpy:103
